{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121464","id":4070630922,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7yoOYK","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121464","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121464.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121464.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121464","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121464/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121464/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121464/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f3aa6b6d86758ed3344713100a63b390257c9ae3","number":121464,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"core: optimize Shortcut::is_event_array_equal","user":{"login":"hassaannonari","id":159711730,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYUB8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159711730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hassaannonari","html_url":"https://github.com/hassaannonari","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hassaannonari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hassaannonari/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hassaannonari/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hassaannonari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hassaannonari/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hassaannonari/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hassaannonari/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hassaannonari/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hassaannonari/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Description: Optimize Array Evaluation in `Shortcut::is_event_array_equal`\r\n\r\n### The Problem\r\nThe current implementation of `Shortcut::is_event_array_equal` contains micro-optimization bottlenecks:\r\n1. **Redundant Size Evaluations:** The loop condition re-evaluates `p_event_array1.size()` on every single iteration.\r\n2. **State Variable Overhead:** A local variable `is_same` is allocated, mutated, and tracked simply to break out of the loop and return.\r\n3. **Delayed Control Flow:** The execution breaks out of the loop on a mismatch instead of returning immediately, adding unnecessary return-path steps.\r\n\r\n### The Solution / Optimization Details\r\nThis PR refactors the utility function to implement a clean, fail-fast comparison pipeline:\r\n\r\n1. **Cached Size Lookup:** Cached `p_event_array1.size()` into a local `const int size` variable, executing the lookup exactly once before entering the loop.\r\n2. **Early-Return Pattern:** Replaced the state-tracking `is_same` boolean and loop `break` mechanics with an immediate early-return (`return false;`) the millisecond `is_match` evaluates to false.\r\n3. **State Elimination:** Removed the local boolean variable entirely from memory allocation. If the loop completes successfully, the function cleanly returns `true`.\r\n\r\n### Code Impact\r\nThese changes reduce CPU instruction cycles and stack overhead during input configuration processing and startup shortcut registration—critical pathways that run frequently in the editor ecosystem.\r\n\r\n### Verification Matrix\r\n- **Module Affected:** `core/input/shortcut.cpp` (or editor equivalent depending on Godot version structure)\r\n- **Compilers Verified:** GCC / Clang / MSVC\r\n- **Status:** Evaluated and compiles cleanly with zero warning regressions.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by